@host = http://localhost:5247
@edition = anniversary
@bossSlug = illidan-stormrage
@encounterId = 50609
@difficultyId = 3
@reportCode = nB13CZbPKgD4J8rz
@fightId = 30

# Replace reportCode/fightId with a visible kill returned by the summary search.
# These requests call this application's API, not WCL directly.
# Live requests require configured WCL credentials and may consume upstream quota.
#
# Search: GET /api/rankings/comp/{bossSlug}
# Required query context: edition, encounterId (> 0) or zoneId (> 0) plus the route boss slug.
# Optional: difficultyId=5 (1-5), page=1 (1-100), refresh=false,
# repeated role/spec filters, killtime_min=0 and killtime_max=0 (seconds).
# Kill-time bounds: 0-86400; max=0 is unbounded, otherwise max must be >= min.
# Up to 100 combined role/spec expressions; role keys: tank, heal, mdps, rdps.
# Expressions: key.eq|lt|gt|lte|gte.count, count 0-100; key.count implies eq.
# Supported editions: anniversary, era, retail, mistsofpandaria, classic_sod.
# Aliases: classic -> era, midnight -> retail, mop or mists of pandaria -> mistsofpandaria.
# Summaries stay complete: filters are validated, not applied to uninspected rosters.
# Search responses: 200, 400, 404, 429, 502; errors use Problem Details.
#
# Details: GET /api/rankings/comp/reports/{code}/fights/{fightId}
# Required: ASCII alphanumeric report code (up to 32 chars), fightId > 0, edition.
# Optional: refresh=false. Loads roster, composition, phases and timelines.
# Detail responses: 200, 400, 403 (private/archived), 404, 429, 502.
# Private/missing reports and upstream errors depend on the selected report/WCL state.

### Complete execution-ranked summary page (up to 50 kills); no roster/detail requests
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&difficultyId={{difficultyId}}
Accept: application/json

### Minimal search: defaults to difficultyId=5, page=1, refresh=false, no filters
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Resolve an encounter missing from static World Data using the selected zone and boss slug
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/archimonde?edition=anniversary&zoneId=1060&difficultyId=3
Accept: application/json

### Every search parameter, including repeated role/spec filters
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&difficultyId={{difficultyId}}&page=1&refresh=false&role=tank.eq.2&role=heal.gte.3&spec=holy-paladin.eq.0&spec=retribution-paladin.lte.2&killtime_min=120&killtime_max=600
Accept: application/json

### Other count comparisons and implicit equality; composition stays pending until inspected
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&difficultyId={{difficultyId}}&role=tank.2&role=mdps.gt.0&role=rdps.lt.20
Accept: application/json

### Minimum-only kill time; killtime_max=0 leaves the upper bound unrestricted
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&difficultyId={{difficultyId}}&killtime_min=120&killtime_max=0
Accept: application/json

### Next upstream summary page
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&difficultyId={{difficultyId}}&page=2
Accept: application/json

### Refresh summary query only; details have an independent refresh parameter
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&difficultyId={{difficultyId}}&refresh=true
Accept: application/json

### Inspect exactly one fight: actual roster, composition, observed phases, cached boss reference
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/reports/{{reportCode}}/fights/{{fightId}}?edition={{edition}}
Accept: application/json

### Refresh only the requested fight, not other rows
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/reports/{{reportCode}}/fights/{{fightId}}?edition={{edition}}&refresh=true
Accept: application/json

### Related legacy queue route: 200 placeholder acknowledgement, NOT a running background job
# Registered by Rankings; defaults are bossSlug=all, limit=50, clear=false.
# The returned taskId is a placeholder; no task-status endpoint is implemented.
POST {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/queue
Accept: application/json

### Queue placeholder with all supported parameters; still does not enqueue work
POST {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/queue?bossSlug={{bossSlug}}&limit=10&clear=true
Accept: application/json

### Invalid expression: 400 Problem Details, without an upstream call
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&role=heal.invalid.2
Accept: application/problem+json

### Unsupported role key: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&role=dps.eq.2
Accept: application/problem+json

### Out-of-range count: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&spec=holy-paladin.eq.101
Accept: application/problem+json

### Reversed kill-time bounds: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&killtime_min=600&killtime_max=120
Accept: application/problem+json

### Invalid difficulty: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&difficultyId=6
Accept: application/problem+json

### Invalid page: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition={{edition}}&encounterId={{encounterId}}&page=101
Accept: application/problem+json

### Unsupported edition: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}?edition=unsupported&encounterId={{encounterId}}
Accept: application/problem+json

### Invalid detail context: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/reports/{{reportCode}}/fights/0?edition={{edition}}
Accept: application/problem+json

### Invalid report-code characters: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/reports/invalid-code/fights/{{fightId}}?edition={{edition}}
Accept: application/problem+json

### Missing detail edition: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/reports/{{reportCode}}/fights/{{fightId}}
Accept: application/problem+json

### Missing required edition/encounter context: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/{{bossSlug}}
Accept: application/problem+json
